1
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,360
You

2
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,400
really are a stubborn mule.

3
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,360
Boss Wu Dongsheng, right?

4
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,920
And you are?

5
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:44,240
I'm Chen Xiaoshan.

6
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,840
I saw your videos online.

7
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,720
You made all these yourself, right?

8
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:49,080
Yes.

9
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,560
But they're not perfect yet.

10
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,120
Individual Exoskeleton Armor.

11
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,440
It looks pretty good.

12
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,280
If you could switch to carbon fiber,

13
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:59,040
it should significantly reduce its weight.

14
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,400
An expert, huh?

15
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:04,040
Looks like you're not here to buy anything.

16
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,120
Our company is currently developing

17
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,440
Individual Exoskeleton Armor.

18
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,759
I stumbled upon your videos online,

19
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,200
so I took the liberty of coming here.

20
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,800
I was wondering if we could collaborate.

21
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,720
I can help you perfect this equipment.

22
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,200
Your company?

23
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,560
Military Dream Group.

24
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:29,960
If you're interested,

25
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,280
we can talk in detail

26
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,800
about the terms and details of our collaboration.

27
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,280
Also, this gentleman is right.

28
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,040
You should sell the shop.

29
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,840
You'll go broke if you keep this up.

30
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:41,760
The whole street outside sells farm produce.

31
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,880
Who would come here to buy outdoor gear?

32
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:47,240
My contact info is on there.

33
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,320
I have things to do, so I'll be going.

34
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:50,640
I'll be back.

35
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:57,840
Dongsheng,

36
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,560
don't believe everything you hear.

37
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,080
There are a lot of scammers out there these days.

38
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,880
Your little bit of severance pay,

39
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,120
you better keep a close eye on it.

40
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,640
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

41
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:16,760
I hope

42
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,080
you have time to look over these

43
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,200
materials and plans.

44
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,480
Based on this plan,

45
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,680
setting up a drone strike range

46
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,160
is completely feasible in my opinion.

47
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:26,800
Comrade Zeng Muhan,

48
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,080
we

49
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,320
shouldn't aim too high.

50
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,520
These new drones

51
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,800
haven't been issued to the troops yet.

52
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,440
It's fine for you to study them first,

53
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:37,680
but

54
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,280
the focus of the training

55
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,760
is still to first master

56
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,880
the reconnaissance drones we already have.

57
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,560
Okay?

58
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,640
Come on, have a seat first.

59
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:53,360
Besides,

60
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,280
in such a short time,

61
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,320
would I dare let you do live-fire shooting?

62
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,360
Deputy Brigade Commander, sir.

63
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,120
During the Korean War,

64
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,360
our pilots only trained for a few days

65
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,640
before getting into a dogfight with US forces.

66
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,000
That was during wartime.

67
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,520
We can't do that now.

68
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,360
Alright,

69
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:11,040
that's it for today.

70
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,200
You're really not going to let this go, are you?

71
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,720
So if I don't agree to it today,

72
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,480
you're just not going to leave?

73
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,160
Sir!

74
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:27,840
Guo Zijian,

75
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:28,800
you're just in time.

76
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,400
Deputy Brigade Commander.

77
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,760
I'm here to report on the new equipment.

78
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,480
That can wait.

79
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:38,600
Let me ask you.

80
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,200
The drone unit's

81
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,840
training plan, have you reviewed it?

82
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,360
Yes, I have.

83
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,200
We have already resolved

84
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,240
all of their support issues.

85
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,560
But now they're requesting that during this period,

86
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,720
they conduct live-fire drone drills,

87
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:54,000
and even set up a shooting range,

88
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:54,840
right?

89
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,200
Yes.

90
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,560
Understood.

91
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,160
I'll go back and implement it right away.

92
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,200
Who told you to implement it?

93
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,240
It's completely unfeasible.

94
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,680
Not entirely unfeasible.

95
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,760
How is it feasible?

96
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:09,720
You think you're so capable.

97
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:10,640
Yes, sir.

98
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,240
Tell you what.

99
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,440
Go back and study it carefully.

100
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,480
We'll talk about it later.

101
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:19,920
Yes, sir.

102
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,600
This is Suo Jian'an.

103
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,960
I've already received the notice.

104
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,000
Okay.

105
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,080
Okay.

106
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,320
Truly a Master's in Engineering.

107
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,360
The materials are very detailed.

108
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,800
So this training subject should work, right?

109
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,080
It won't.

110
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,280
Why not?

111
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,480
As for the reason,

112
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,680
didn't Deputy Brigade Commander Suo make it clear?

113
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,920
He told us to study it ourselves first.

114
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,400
Judging by his tone,

115
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,880
there should be room for discussion.

116
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:05,560
I'm sorry.

117
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:07,840
There's nothing I can do.

118
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:13,160
Captain Guo.

119
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,200
To be honest,

120
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,040
I've heard a lot of rumors about you.

121
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,600
But ever since the last exercise,

122
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,560
I've always believed

123
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,800
that you're definitely not someone

124
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,720
who only cares about grandstanding.

125
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,080
But now I think

126
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:29,800
I might have misjudged you.

127
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,960
Or is it because you got a few demerits

128
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,080
that you no longer dare to stand your ground?

129
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,800
Is that really what you think?

130
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,080
That's right.

131
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,800
That's exactly what I think.

132
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:49,880
Sorry to waste your time, Captain Guo.

133
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,440
That EQ is even worse than mine.

134
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,200
Easy now.

135
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:11,880
Don't damage the equipment.

136
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,240
Take it slow.

137
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,560
Over here.

138
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,960
Li Songwei.

139
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:20,720
Yes, sir!

140
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,000
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

141
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:29,680
What are you moving?

142
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:32,160
It's the training equipment

143
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,000
Captain Guo sourced from local factories.

144
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,320
What equipment?

145
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,360
We have drones,

146
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,680
and advanced electronic training devices.

147
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:38,960
There's quite a lot.

148
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,200
Where is Guo Zijian?

149
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:44,200
They're upstairs to sign with Director Xu.

150
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:46,960
Alright.

151
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:47,400
Carry on.

152
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,000
Yes, sir!

153
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,200
Guo Zijian is working so hard.

154
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,480
Looks like this kid

155
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,120
is going all out in the training camp

156
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,000
to secure a spot.

157
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,560
Give me a hand.

158
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,360
Easy, easy.

159
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,520
I really didn't expect

160
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,200
Ms. Chen to be so young.

161
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,800
It really is a young person's world now.

162
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:14,000
You see, this time,

163
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,520
thanks to Ms. Chen for helping us acquire

164
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:17,800
so much advanced equipment.

165
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,840
And the Armed Reconnaissance Drone too.

166
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:20,960
Thank you.

167
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,480
Sir, you flatter me.

168
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,200
I'm just a junior.

169
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:25,080
Just call me Xiaoshan from now on.

170
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,360
I just helped out with

171
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,640
some of the networking.

172
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,480
To collaborate with our beloved troops

173
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,640
is our company's honor.

174
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,080
Good.

175
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,120
Then don't be so modest.

176
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,640
You're already very remarkable.

177
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:36,840
As you young folks say, let's gow.

178
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,039
Let's go!

179
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:39,840
Let's go!

180
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,200
You're so funny, sir.

181
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,200
I still have some things to handle.

182
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,120
Zijian.

183
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:45,720
Here!

184
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:47,920
You take good care of Xiaoshan.

185
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,160
You're the Support Unit Leader.

186
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,360
The quality of your support

187
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,400
should be a bit higher.

188
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:52,160
Understood.

189
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,320
Rest assured, Director.

190
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:57,720
You young people chat for a while.

191
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:58,360
You young people chat for a while.

192
00:08:59,040 --> 00:08:59,280
Yes, sir.

193
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,560
How did I do, Bro?

194
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,480
I didn't embarrass you, did I?

195
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,440
Not bad, keep it up.

196
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:09,480
Also,

197
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,360
our relationship must absolutely...

198
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:12,880
Understood.

199
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,760
Our relationship must be kept a secret.

200
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:18,560
So how are you going to thank me?

201
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,560
I'll get you a chicken leg for dinner.

202
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:24,040
Just a chicken leg?

203
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,280
You heard him, improve the quality.

204
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,600
Then what else do you want?

205
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:29,960
I want to shoot a gun.

206
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:30,960
Pistol, rifle, machine gun.

207
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:31,960
I want to shoot them all.

208
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,520
In your dreams.

209
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:39,400
Guess you don't want news on Wu Dongsheng.

210
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:42,800
How is he doing?

211
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:46,320
Fine.

212
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,200
Come next time we have target practice.

213
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,680
I'll take you to shoot a few rounds.

214
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:51,480
And let you have a try.

215
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,200
Okay?

216
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:04,600
Your recon squad leader is hard to handle.

217
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:05,920
I went through a lot of trouble

218
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,960
to recruit him to Military Dream Group.

219
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,920
To fit him with a bionic limb for free,

220
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,520
without revealing our relationship.

221
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:13,680
The story I made up...

222
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,360
I should be a screenwriter.

223
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,040
This Wu Dongsheng

224
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,320
is very talented.

225
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,800
Getting him on board

226
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,400
is a blessing for your company.

227
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:25,200
Now that he's fitted with this,

228
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,560
is he having any trouble adapting?

229
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,960
To be honest,

230
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,200
even though this is already

231
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,800
the latest smart prosthetic limb,

232
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:34,560
the issue of skin chafing and irritation

233
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,480
still exists.

234
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:38,000
But the others fitted around the same time

235
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,160
are all screaming in pain.

236
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,120
He

237
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,800
hasn't made a single sound.

238
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:43,400
Bro,

239
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,200
are all of you soldiers

240
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:46,200
really this good at enduring pain?

241
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,240
That's what you call an iron will.

242
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,760
You have to take good care of him for me.

243
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:54,640
Don't treat him poorly.

244
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,720
Of course. Even in his condition,

245
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:59,320
he still stepped up during that incident last time.

246
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,040
I've got his back for sure.

247
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,960
Look at you.

248
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,520
Let's go.

249
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,240
Staff Officer Liang,

250
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,240
where are you going?

251
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,360
Battalion Commander Guo.

252
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,920
I'm looking for Director Xu.

253
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:11,400
The director just left.

254
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:13,960
By the way,

255
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,280
about that post last time...

256
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:17,520
Thank you.

257
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,640
What post?

258
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:22,040
The one analyzing the battle.

259
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,080
If it weren't for you...

260
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:24,640
Don't worry about it.

261
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:27,360
That analysis was just for discussion.

262
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,160
It wasn't because of you.

263
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:33,560
But I still have to thank you.

264
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,920
If you ever need my help,

265
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,080
just say the word.

266
00:11:50,160 --> 00:11:50,800
Who is it?

267
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,360
Don't overthink it.

268
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,680
Just a colleague.

269
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,280
Don't tell me then.

270
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,280
She looks so aloof.

271
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,240
You can't handle her, can you?

272
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,480
Why are you so gossipy?

273
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:04,440
Sir!

274
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:05,440
Come in.

275
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:10,680
Deputy Brigade Commander.

276
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:13,240
Commander Long from the 404th called me.

277
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,400
Saying that according to the plan,

278
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,200
he's coming to lecture the training team.

279
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:17,960
He asked how the itinerary is arranged.

280
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,040
Director Xu went to the group army,

281
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:20,920
so I came over.

282
00:12:20,920 --> 00:12:21,880
I'm aware of this.

283
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:22,800
You don't need to worry about it.

284
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,320
I'll arrange for someone to receive him.

285
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,120
You can leave it to me.

286
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:26,760
But Brigade Commander Long...

287
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:27,640
Alright, that will be all.

288
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:31,920
I'm on my way.

289
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:34,800
Okay, right away, right away.

290
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,280
The Red-Blue Confrontation...

291
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,360
Since it will always be an inevitable

292
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,640
clash of rivals on our training grounds,

293
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,560
then I hope this kind of clash

294
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,880
will definitely be full of unknowns,

295
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:51,760
and full of variables.

296
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,000
But these unknowns and variables...

297
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:55,520
Obviously,

298
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,920
on our future training grounds,

299
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:00,600
only applying new-type combat forces

300
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,160
can make it

301
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,920
unleash a kaleidoscope of

302
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,440
marvelous spectacles.

303
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:09,040
In this sense,

304
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,000
comrades,

305
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,040
you are,

306
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:15,520
for these unknowns and variables,

307
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,280
the pioneers.

308
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,200
Let's work hard together.

309
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,440
A true Opposing Force commander,

310
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:32,040
that lecture was top-notch.

311
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:33,280
Come on.

312
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,440
Stop being so sarcastic with me.

313
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,640
What's going on with your Guo Zijian?

314
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,120
That's not cool of him at all.

315
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,600
I specifically asked him to welcome me.

316
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,320
It's one thing to skip the lecture,

317
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,040
but why haven't I seen a trace of him?

318
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:51,120
Guo Zijian is now the Support Unit Leader.

319
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,080
He's so busy all day

320
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,200
he's run off his feet.

321
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:54,320
What?

322
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,320
You have a history with him?

323
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:57,680
On the battlefield,

324
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,680
he almost wiped out my base twice.

325
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,280
How could our history not be deep?

326
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,280
But I have to say, Old Suo,

327
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,360
such a military talent...

328
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:08,040
If you guys don't appreciate him,

329
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,560
just give him to my 404th Brigade.

330
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,680
It's one thing if you don't use him,

331
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:13,680
but you even assigned him as some...

332
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:14,880
Support Unit Leader.

333
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,240
Isn't that just insulting?

334
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,520
I have to say, your words...

335
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,280
don't sound like a brigade commander.

336
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,240
Do you think I have the final say in this?

337
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:24,320
The brigade's party committee decided it.

338
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,360
Fine.

339
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:28,000
Don't hide behind the party committee.

340
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:29,760
I know

341
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:31,720
that you, Old Suo, prefer people

342
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,200
who are obedient,

343
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,640
docile, and reliable.

344
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:35,560
Alright.

345
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:36,720
I won't interfere.

346
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:37,600
Okay?

347
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:40,160
It's easy for you to say.

348
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:41,720
I'm telling you,

349
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,400
if I actually gave him to you,

350
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:46,520
you wouldn't be smiling.

351
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:48,360
Really.

352
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:49,920
It's a pity

353
00:14:51,680 --> 00:14:53,520
that he sees me purely as a rival.

354
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:56,160
He'd rather be a caterpillar here with you

355
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,840
than go to my place and make waves.

356
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:00,640
Alright.

357
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,680
Keep your Support Unit Leader and use him.

358
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:03,360
I'm leaving.

359
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,440
Thank you, Brigade Commander Long.

360
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,440
Brigade Commander Long.

361
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,640
Where have you been, kid?

362
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,320
I was just delivering boxed lunches.

363
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:37,360
What?

364
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,880
Addicted to being the Support Unit Leader?

365
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:41,280
Planning to deliver meals forever?

366
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,280
You must have some orders for me.

367
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:43,880
Go ahead.

368
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:45,960
Guo Zijian.

369
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:49,000
You have no future in the 396th Brigade.

370
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,360
You know this very well yourself.

371
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,920
A tree dies when moved, a person thrives.

372
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:55,160
If you want to make a comeback,

373
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:57,080
leave the 396th Brigade immediately.

374
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:57,920
Come join me.

375
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:00,000
Just give the word,

376
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,560
I'll handle all the paperwork for you.

377
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:03,400
Brigade Commander Long,

378
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,520
thank you for valuing me so highly.

379
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:06,880
So you agree?

380
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:09,760
These recent setbacks

381
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:12,480
really did hurt quite a bit.

382
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,120
But if I just leave like this,

383
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:16,800
I'd be letting down the comrades

384
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:18,560
who fought alongside me.

385
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:20,720
Right.

386
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:22,800
Doing this

387
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,440
shows you value loyalty.

388
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:26,760
But I also have to tell you,

389
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,000
if you want to stand back up,

390
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:32,080
having backbone and skills isn't enough.

391
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:33,840
You need an opportunity and a platform.

392
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:36,240
You are just wasting your own talent.

393
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:36,880
You know what?

394
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,640
You'll stray further and further

395
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,560
from the army's development path.

396
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,400
When you finally want to stand up,

397
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:42,160
you'll have no strength left.

398
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:44,160
You have to fight for your opportunities.

399
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,920
Do you know what the biggest perk

400
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:47,440
of being the Support Unit Leader is?

401
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,360
Being well-informed.

402
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:51,280
The group army,

403
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,560
including the theater army,

404
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:55,280
is currently discussing plans

405
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,440
for the final placement of this training team.

406
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:57,240
By convention,

407
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,280
people returned to where they came from.

408
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:02,080
But this is for new-type combat forces.

409
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,560
It's a brand new attempt.

410
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,000
It'll definitely be different from before.

411
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:06,240
Okay.

412
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:08,640
You really are well-informed, kid.

413
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,000
That's right.

414
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:11,960
The theater army

415
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:14,400
is preparing to use this training pilot

416
00:17:14,839 --> 00:17:16,800
to build a new-type combat forces

417
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:17,680
combined unit.

418
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:18,560
Battalion scale.

419
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:20,200
But the combined method,

420
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:21,960
branch combinations, and personnel makeup

421
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,520
haven't been finalized yet.

422
00:17:25,119 --> 00:17:27,119
But many people have already taken action.

423
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,840
Although I still don't know the specifics

424
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,400
of how it will work,

425
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:32,040
I think

426
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:35,000
this is indeed a massive opportunity.

427
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,400
As long as you come to my 404th Brigade,

428
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,040
I am confident

429
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:41,760
I can get you into this Combined Arms Battalion.

430
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:42,880
If there is an opportunity,

431
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:45,360
I hope to compete in my current role.

432
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:46,880
Sorry, Brigade Commander Long.

433
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:47,960
I can't agree to your offer.

434
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,640
Looks like you made up your mind long ago.

435
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:53,040
That's why I'd rather be the Support Unit Leader

436
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:55,000
to get into the training team.

437
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:57,160
You've got backbone.

438
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:58,720
I guess I wasn't wrong about you.

439
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:00,960
But there's one thing

440
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,440
I really don't understand.

441
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:04,880
Suo Jian'an has already pinned you down

442
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,920
and wants to use your face as a mop.

443
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:10,040
Why do you insist on staying in the 396th?

444
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,600
Deputy Commander Suo didn't pin me down.

445
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:15,960
I fell on my own, I don't blame anyone.

446
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:16,680
Fine.

447
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,240
I still couldn't win you over after all.

448
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,440
I won't force you.

449
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:24,360
But like I said,

450
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:26,320
the doors to the 404th Brigade

451
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,200
will always be open to you.

452
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,520
I went to a meeting at the Theater Army

453
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,920
and brought back some very valuable data.

454
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:42,480
Take a look.

455
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:46,120
If you say it's good, Sir, it must be.

456
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:48,120
Our training unit

457
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:50,080
is like a well-kept secret.

458
00:18:50,720 --> 00:18:52,160
Once people find out about it,

459
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:54,120
the suitors just keep coming,

460
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:55,520
breaking down the doors.

461
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,360
They're all smart.

462
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:00,120
Who wouldn't catch on to this?

463
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,400
To be honest,

464
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,160
there are so many people asking me for favors,

465
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,520
trying to join the training unit halfway.

466
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:08,760
This shows that New-type combat forces

467
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:11,440
and their guiding role in the Army's future

468
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:13,760
have garnered enough attention.

469
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:17,520
As the Chinese Army's overall strength grows,

470
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:19,400
it must be able to fly and jump,

471
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:21,120
travel a thousand miles a day,

472
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:24,680
and achieve multi-domain defense.

473
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:27,560
It sounds like a few buzzwords,

474
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:29,280
but to actually do it,

475
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:32,440
it takes a lifetime of dedication.

476
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,880
A lifetime of dedication is nothing.

477
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:37,320
It's worth going bald for.

478
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:39,360
Sir.

479
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,360
Regarding the final integration,

480
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:45,200
we have an idea. We'd like your input.

481
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,400
A competition.

482
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:50,600
We're having a competition?

483
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:51,600
Yes.

484
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:52,560
This is to find a leader

485
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:55,560
for the future New-type combat forces Combined Arms Battalion.

486
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:56,680
Exactly.

487
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,840
We'll issue a Call for Talent in the unit.

488
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,080
Anyone who is interested

489
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:03,000
can freely form teams and sign up.

490
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,240
This Call for Talent of yours

491
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:06,680
has been in the works for a while.

492
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:07,720
I think the plan is feasible.

493
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:10,240
Report it to the Group Army commanders.

494
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,360
Once you get their approval,

495
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:12,640
you can implement it.

496
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:13,880
Yes, sir.

497
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:16,960
You brat.

498
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,080
Happy now?

499
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,520
This Call for Talent

500
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:25,320
seems tailor-made for you.

501
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:28,520
Sir!

502
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,360
Sir, please don't say that.

503
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:32,240
The Group Army has many capable people.

504
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:33,880
Don't act modest when you've got the edge.

505
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:35,320
All right, sit down.

506
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:36,200
Yes, sir.

507
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:40,680
I mean it, Sir.

508
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:43,040
When it comes to New-type combat forces,

509
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:44,840
I still have a long way to go.

510
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:47,000
You haven't grasped the memo's intent.

511
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:51,000
This selection process

512
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:53,080
is for the future.

513
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:55,240
Think about it.

514
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:59,440
If the people we choose are already omnipotent,

515
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:01,760
then what's the point of choosing?

516
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:06,240
Sir,

517
00:21:08,120 --> 00:21:09,120
I don't quite understand.

518
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:11,160
Director Xu and I

519
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:12,360
have discussed this.

520
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:13,600
This time,

521
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:15,440
the team confrontation

522
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:17,400
will mainly be a simulation.

523
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:21,000
The focus is on teamwork.

524
00:21:21,600 --> 00:21:25,040
Applying New-type combat forces in battle

525
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:29,120
it's still at a conceptual level.

526
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:31,120
It's not a practical combat operation.

527
00:21:34,280 --> 00:21:34,960
Understood.

528
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:39,120
But because it's at the conceptual level,

529
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:42,000
for team leaders like you,

530
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,680
it places higher demands

531
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,480
and greater challenges.

532
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:46,800
First,

533
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,960
your concepts

534
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:50,680
must be advanced.

535
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:51,760
Second,

536
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,960
your tactics must be cutting-edge.

537
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:55,120
Third...

538
00:21:55,520 --> 00:21:57,200
Third, the integrated use of forces

539
00:21:57,880 --> 00:22:00,040
must adapt to the future battlefield.

540
00:22:01,640 --> 00:22:02,440
You're right.

541
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:05,880
This won't happen overnight.

542
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:06,840
Therefore,

543
00:22:07,800 --> 00:22:09,640
excellent battalion commanders like you

544
00:22:10,400 --> 00:22:11,640
will have an opportunity.

545
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:14,840
Then, in your opinion,

546
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:16,800
how should I build my team?

547
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,160
First.

548
00:22:22,960 --> 00:22:23,840
You need familiarity.

549
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:25,800
Familiarity makes it smooth.

550
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:27,440
Second.

551
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:29,080
A foundation of teamwork.

552
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,320
That way,

553
00:22:30,600 --> 00:22:31,800
we avoid internal friction.

554
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:33,640
Third.

555
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:36,000
Both skills and intelligence

556
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:38,000
must be cutting-edge.

557
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:43,320
Inside the training camp,

558
00:22:44,040 --> 00:22:45,080
are there any capable people?

559
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,320
Our training camp

560
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:51,960
might be full of elites,

561
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:53,400
but

562
00:22:54,280 --> 00:22:56,000
the gathering time is short,

563
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:58,640
and we have so many subjects.

564
00:22:58,840 --> 00:22:59,440
Because of this,

565
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:01,160
our expertise takes a hit.

566
00:23:02,080 --> 00:23:03,200
Most importantly,

567
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:05,240
we come from different units.

568
00:23:05,720 --> 00:23:06,840
Everyone's working style,

569
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:08,040
ingrained mindset,

570
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:08,960
as well as

571
00:23:09,280 --> 00:23:11,560
habits from previous units

572
00:23:12,480 --> 00:23:14,840
will become obstacles to teamwork.

573
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,800
Like I just said,

574
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:17,840
internal friction.

575
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,200
Understood.

576
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:23,680
We have a foundation in special ops.

577
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:26,840
And with EW, long-range artillery,

578
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:28,280
army aviation, and other branches,

579
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:29,520
we've had joint drills.

580
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,280
I am confident.

581
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,400
Good.

582
00:23:34,600 --> 00:23:36,280
That's exactly what I want to hear.

583
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:37,800
Remember,

584
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,520
this time, no matter what,

585
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,920
you must win back the dignity

586
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,240
of our 396th Brigade.

587
00:23:43,800 --> 00:23:45,920
Yes, sir. I'll complete the mission.

588
00:23:46,360 --> 00:23:47,520
You are the group army's

589
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,960
model Battalion Commander for two years,

590
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:51,840
and in this training camp,

591
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,840
the only active Combined Arms Battalion Cmdr.

592
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:55,880
In this confrontation,

593
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:57,120
your performance

594
00:23:57,520 --> 00:23:59,480
has earned the unanimous praise

595
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:00,600
of all the group army leaders.

596
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,280
Even though

597
00:24:02,800 --> 00:24:03,680
Guo Zijian

598
00:24:04,080 --> 00:24:06,240
almost pulled off a decapitation strike,

599
00:24:06,600 --> 00:24:07,240
ultimately,

600
00:24:07,560 --> 00:24:08,720
he was one step short.

601
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,240
From this perspective,

602
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:11,880
your performance was

603
00:24:12,120 --> 00:24:13,200
far better

604
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,560
and had a greater impact.

605
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:18,400
Speaking of Guo Zijian,

606
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,120
I heard

607
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:21,840
he's also signing up.

608
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:23,240
Knowing his personality,

609
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:25,680
do you think he'd miss this chance?

610
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:27,280
What?

611
00:24:28,040 --> 00:24:28,960
Feeling the pressure?

612
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:31,600
Look at me,

613
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:33,880
do I look like I'm pressured?

614
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:36,000
But to be honest, sir,

615
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,160
hearing he's signing up

616
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:39,240
makes me very excited.

617
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:40,240
Don't worry.

618
00:24:40,600 --> 00:24:41,520
This time,

619
00:24:41,760 --> 00:24:43,280
I will definitely crush him.

620
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:44,000
Good.

621
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,320
Let me tell you,

622
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:47,160
in my mind,

623
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,880
between you and Guo Zijian,

624
00:24:49,560 --> 00:24:50,480
without a competition,

625
00:24:50,800 --> 00:24:51,880
the winner is obvious.

626
00:24:53,240 --> 00:24:54,440
Don't even worry about him.

627
00:24:55,080 --> 00:24:56,320
Spend more time thinking about

628
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:57,600
what exactly

629
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:59,520
your shortcomings and weaknesses are.

630
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:01,040
Yes, sir.

631
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:04,440
Staff Officer Liang,

632
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,360
I heard

633
00:25:05,760 --> 00:25:07,520
Guo Zijian also accepted the Call for Talent.

634
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:14,880
Where did you hear all this from?

635
00:25:15,800 --> 00:25:17,120
Don't worry about that.

636
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:19,120
But today I finally understood

637
00:25:19,520 --> 00:25:21,240
what you were saying back then.

638
00:25:22,040 --> 00:25:23,800
"Having a spot is an opportunity"—

639
00:25:24,120 --> 00:25:25,280
I finally get what that means.

640
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,080
Staff Officer Liang,

641
00:25:29,520 --> 00:25:30,680
did you already know

642
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:31,680
Guo Zijian's intentions?

643
00:25:32,760 --> 00:25:34,080
Knowing his personality,

644
00:25:34,080 --> 00:25:34,680
he wouldn't

645
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,520
just move cabbages in the support unit forever.

646
00:25:37,600 --> 00:25:39,280
He was waiting for an opportunity.

647
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:41,440
Now that the opportunity is here,

648
00:25:42,760 --> 00:25:44,120
he will definitely seize it.

649
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:47,080
Hearing you say that,

650
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:49,960
why does it feel like the return of a king?

651
00:25:51,840 --> 00:25:52,600
Staff Officer Liang,

652
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:54,720
tell me the truth.

653
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,320
Is it because of Guo Zijian

654
00:25:56,320 --> 00:25:58,520
that you delayed joining the Beijing camp?

655
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:01,480
What does that have to do with him?

656
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,040
Fine, it has nothing to do with him.

657
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:07,520
Then analyze this for me.

658
00:26:07,840 --> 00:26:09,240
Who will he team up with this time?

659
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:13,840
If he wants to seize this opportunity,

660
00:26:14,920 --> 00:26:16,280
then he will definitely

661
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:19,440
gather the best people from the training camp.

662
00:26:21,960 --> 00:26:23,280
Will he invite us?

663
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:25,240
That depends on his judgment.

664
00:26:25,480 --> 00:26:26,840
I think he definitely will.

665
00:26:27,080 --> 00:26:28,440
For New-type combat forces,

666
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:30,040
electronic warfare is a crucial part.

667
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:32,200
Who's better than us in this field?

668
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:35,160
Why are you so excited?

669
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:36,600
Of course I am.

670
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,920
Haven't you noticed?

671
00:26:37,920 --> 00:26:40,480
With Guo Zijian, there are always surprises.

672
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,760
My "Sword and Rainbow" duo

673
00:26:43,760 --> 00:26:45,400
is about to make its grand debut!

674
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,440
But don't celebrate too early.

675
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,840
Given his current situation,

676
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:56,320
whether he can even form a team

677
00:26:56,360 --> 00:26:57,280
is still a question.

678
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:06,800
Look at this, look at this.

679
00:27:07,120 --> 00:27:08,120
What did I tell you?

680
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:10,120
Our Battalion Commander has been biding his time.

681
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:12,680
He brought you all here

682
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:15,240
hoping to form a team with you.

683
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:17,520
But if you have better options,

684
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:18,480
I won't force you.

685
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:19,520
Captain,

686
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:21,240
what are you talking about?

687
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:22,640
On this team today,

688
00:27:22,640 --> 00:27:23,400
if there isn't a spot for me,

689
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:23,880
I'm telling you,

690
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:26,040
I'll... I'll just refuse to leave.

691
00:27:26,040 --> 00:27:26,880
All right, all right.

692
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:28,240
Cut the crap.

693
00:27:29,320 --> 00:27:29,920
Li Songwei!

694
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:30,920
Here!

695
00:27:30,920 --> 00:27:31,320
Lin Yihu!

696
00:27:31,680 --> 00:27:32,160
Here!

697
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,720
You've been with me in the support unit

698
00:27:34,840 --> 00:27:35,960
and lost a lot of time.

699
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:37,640
You need to work overtime these next few days

700
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:40,240
to catch up on what you missed quickly.

701
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,720
Don't worry, Battalion Commander.

702
00:27:41,920 --> 00:27:43,360
We guarantee we'll complete the mission.

703
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:44,720
Battalion Commander,

704
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:46,960
aren't we a bit short-handed with just us?

705
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:49,960
Could we bring Zeng Muhan

706
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,720
into the team as well?

707
00:27:51,240 --> 00:27:52,880
He might not talk much,

708
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,560
and he can be a bit arrogant,

709
00:27:53,720 --> 00:27:54,480
but I believe

710
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,600
this guy is definitely an ace.

711
00:28:11,120 --> 00:28:11,720
Check this out.

712
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:19,720
Did you make all these?

713
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:22,280
Ready for live-fire practice anytime.

714
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,920
But didn't you say earlier

715
00:28:25,040 --> 00:28:26,600
that it was impossible without resources?

716
00:28:27,120 --> 00:28:28,840
We lacked armed reconnaissance drones,

717
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:30,600
so there was really nothing I could do.

718
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,080
Captain Guo.

719
00:28:35,280 --> 00:28:35,920
Before,

720
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,920
I was too eager for success.

721
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:39,120
I spoke too harshly.

722
00:28:40,320 --> 00:28:41,120
I apologize.

723
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:42,640
I know

724
00:28:43,360 --> 00:28:44,760
you were the one who got those drones.

725
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:47,880
I'm applying to join your team.

726
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:50,280
I didn't do this to buy you off.

727
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,080
And I'm not being bought off.

728
00:28:53,920 --> 00:28:54,920
I'm joining your team

729
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:56,480
because after this incident

730
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,160
and the last exercise,

731
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:00,280
I'm more and more convinced

732
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:01,760
that you can win.

733
00:29:02,360 --> 00:29:02,680
No,

734
00:29:03,600 --> 00:29:04,840
that we can win.

735
00:29:07,680 --> 00:29:08,360
Staff Officer Liang,

736
00:29:08,360 --> 00:29:10,080
the Call for Talent opened two days ago.

737
00:29:10,080 --> 00:29:11,160
Has Guo Zijian come looking for you?

738
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:13,160
No.

739
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,960
Which proves his judgment isn't that great.

740
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:15,440
Staff Officer Liang!

741
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:18,200
Here he comes. Speak of the devil.

742
00:29:19,080 --> 00:29:19,960
Hello, Captain Guo.

743
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:20,400
Squad Leader Hong,

744
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:21,520
Staff Officer Liang. Hello.

745
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:22,520
Hello, Captain Guo.

746
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:23,400
Is there something you need?

747
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,400
Long story short,

748
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:26,080
I've already signed up for

749
00:29:26,080 --> 00:29:27,400
the Combined Arms Battalion Call for Talent.

750
00:29:27,640 --> 00:29:29,400
Right now, Lin Yihu, Li Songwei,

751
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:30,560
Dongfang Qingtian, Yang Maolin,

752
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:31,560
and Zeng Muhan

753
00:29:31,560 --> 00:29:33,200
have agreed to join my team.

754
00:29:34,160 --> 00:29:34,880
Then congratulations.

755
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:36,320
Captain Guo, I have high hopes for you.

756
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,760
Thank you.

757
00:29:37,960 --> 00:29:40,360
But I'm still short a senior staff officer

758
00:29:40,360 --> 00:29:41,920
and an electronic warfare expert.

759
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:44,520
So I'm officially inviting you both.

760
00:29:44,600 --> 00:29:46,600
I hope you can join my team.

761
00:29:46,760 --> 00:29:47,920
No problem! No problem!

762
00:29:47,960 --> 00:29:48,400
Captain Guo,

763
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:49,200
we are very happy.

764
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:50,640
Thank you for the invitation, Captain Guo.

765
00:29:51,040 --> 00:29:52,120
But over the past two days,

766
00:29:52,120 --> 00:29:53,920
several teams have already invited us.

767
00:29:54,600 --> 00:29:56,400
I still need to comprehensively evaluate

768
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:57,520
the characteristics of each team

769
00:29:57,520 --> 00:29:59,160
before deciding whether to accept.

770
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:00,520
Staff Officer Liang,

771
00:30:01,360 --> 00:30:03,400
my team members are the elite of the elite.

772
00:30:03,840 --> 00:30:05,120
You've seen their capabilities.

773
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:07,360
If you two can join,

774
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:09,200
I can't guarantee a championship,

775
00:30:09,320 --> 00:30:10,920
but the top three is guaranteed.

776
00:30:11,520 --> 00:30:12,200
Of course,

777
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:13,840
for you, this honor

778
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:15,360
is just icing on the cake.

779
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,560
But for me,

780
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:18,320
it's a lifeline.

781
00:30:18,760 --> 00:30:20,440
Take your time. I'll wait for your word.

782
00:30:24,080 --> 00:30:26,640
Staff Officer Liang, why didn't you say yes?

783
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:30,080
I just gave my reasons.

784
00:30:30,760 --> 00:30:31,960
Besides, I didn't say no.

785
00:30:32,360 --> 00:30:34,000
I just need some time to think it over.

786
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:36,760
But why do I feel like you're being moody?

787
00:30:38,320 --> 00:30:39,320
Why would I be moody?

788
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:41,560
Because we were the last ones he sought out.

789
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:44,920
Staff Officer Liang!

790
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:45,960
Staff Officer Liang!

791
00:30:49,480 --> 00:30:49,920
Wait,

792
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:50,880
stop doing that for now.

793
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:51,480
Okay.

794
00:30:59,520 --> 00:31:01,280
The special ops urban assault training

795
00:31:01,280 --> 00:31:02,320
needs a simulation site.

796
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,480
When the time comes,

797
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,960
I'll talk to Captain Wang

798
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:06,480
about adding climbing points on the wall.

799
00:31:06,480 --> 00:31:07,440
Using it as a training ground

800
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:08,440
isn't a bad idea.

801
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:09,640
That's great!

802
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:10,880
Thank you, Captain!

803
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:12,320
Recently, the Special Operations Academy

804
00:31:12,480 --> 00:31:14,120
has arranged quite a few courses for you.

805
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:14,960
For all those lessons,

806
00:31:14,960 --> 00:31:17,040
you have to force them down no matter what.

807
00:31:17,240 --> 00:31:18,560
Understood. Don't worry.

808
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:20,000
Alright, I'm heading off.

809
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:21,400
Captain, where are you going?

810
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:22,560
To make an earnest appeal.

811
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:31,880
Come in.

812
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:36,720
Captain Guo.

813
00:31:40,520 --> 00:31:41,040
What is this?

814
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:41,840
Take a look.

815
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:47,400
My original goal was the top three.

816
00:31:47,560 --> 00:31:49,200
Now, looking at their scores,

817
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:50,760
winning the championship is possible.

818
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:52,720
Staff Officer Liang,

819
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:54,440
have you made your decision?

820
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:03,200
That's okay.

821
00:32:03,320 --> 00:32:04,360
There is still time.

822
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:05,520
Keep thinking about it.

823
00:32:06,160 --> 00:32:07,680
This position won't go to anyone else.

824
00:32:08,080 --> 00:32:09,280
You are the only choice.

825
00:32:11,240 --> 00:32:11,920
Guo Zijian.

826
00:32:17,520 --> 00:32:18,520
I can join you.

827
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,680
But it's not to do you a favor.

828
00:32:22,520 --> 00:32:23,760
I want to experience firsthand

829
00:32:23,760 --> 00:32:24,840
how the new-type combat forces

830
00:32:24,840 --> 00:32:26,800
truly perform in actual combat.

831
00:32:28,560 --> 00:32:30,000
You made the right choice.

832
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,160
Wangyuan.

833
00:32:58,360 --> 00:32:59,800
For this challenge match,

834
00:33:00,320 --> 00:33:01,840
I think you should sit it out.

835
00:33:04,120 --> 00:33:05,160
Do you think

836
00:33:06,560 --> 00:33:07,920
I'm not capable enough?

837
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:10,480
I'm glad you're enthusiastic.

838
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:13,040
But I suggest

839
00:33:13,560 --> 00:33:14,520
you focus your energy

840
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:16,800
on your primary duties.

841
00:33:17,760 --> 00:33:18,360
To

842
00:33:18,600 --> 00:33:20,560
improve your combat and training skills

843
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:22,360
is better than anything else.

844
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:24,840
There will be plenty of opportunities.

845
00:33:27,600 --> 00:33:28,480
Let's eat first.

846
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,480
I know

847
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:34,960
you're looking out for me.

848
00:33:35,200 --> 00:33:37,560
You're worried that if I get eliminated,

849
00:33:37,560 --> 00:33:38,880
I'll lose face,

850
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:39,480
right?

851
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:41,240
If that's what you really think,

852
00:33:41,520 --> 00:33:42,640
then I admit it.

853
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:46,640
But I heard

854
00:33:46,800 --> 00:33:48,000
Guo Zijian signed up too.

855
00:33:48,360 --> 00:33:50,360
He's been recruiting people for a team.

856
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:51,960
He even got Dr. Liang Hong

857
00:33:52,320 --> 00:33:53,440
to join them.

858
00:33:53,560 --> 00:33:54,280
That's right.

859
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:55,760
I can see that they

860
00:33:56,080 --> 00:33:57,280
are highly motivated.

861
00:33:57,560 --> 00:33:58,880
And they train very hard.

862
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,480
It seems

863
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:02,000
they want to use this opportunity

864
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:03,280
to make a comeback.

865
00:34:06,760 --> 00:34:07,480
But

866
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:09,719
with Jiang Shengqiang and his guys around,

867
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,760
this makeshift squad

868
00:34:12,600 --> 00:34:13,719
might not stand a chance.

869
00:34:15,159 --> 00:34:16,560
True,

870
00:34:17,400 --> 00:34:18,440
but

871
00:34:18,440 --> 00:34:19,760
I still feel

872
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:22,280
Guo Zijian participating in this

873
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:23,400
in itself

874
00:34:24,719 --> 00:34:25,800
is inappropriate.

875
00:34:28,239 --> 00:34:29,199
Look, Wangyuan.

876
00:34:31,440 --> 00:34:33,400
Put your personal prejudice aside.

877
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:35,480
This is a completely separate matter.

878
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:39,120
This time,

879
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:41,120
it's open to the entire training camp,

880
00:34:41,120 --> 00:34:42,560
all commanders and soldiers.

881
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:43,840
Right?

882
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:44,880
We are calling for talent.

883
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:47,719
Never mind he's the Support Unit Leader.

884
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:49,040
Even if you were just a

885
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:50,920
regular driver

886
00:34:51,639 --> 00:34:52,360
or from the mess squad,

887
00:34:52,719 --> 00:34:53,840
you could still sign up.

888
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:55,679
We recruit talent regardless of status.

889
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:57,480
Yes,

890
00:34:57,760 --> 00:35:00,040
I understand all that.

891
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:01,440
But after all,

892
00:35:01,440 --> 00:35:03,480
he still has a disciplinary mark.

893
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:09,520
Stop fixating on Guo Zijian.

894
00:35:11,200 --> 00:35:12,560
Look at the bigger picture.

895
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:13,640
Okay?

896
00:35:14,600 --> 00:35:15,600
The facts have proven

897
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:16,840
that what happened before

898
00:35:17,120 --> 00:35:18,680
didn't have much to do with him.

899
00:35:19,520 --> 00:35:20,480
You're right.

900
00:35:21,760 --> 00:35:23,080
As for the food pot incident,

901
00:35:23,360 --> 00:35:24,480
we did wrong him.

902
00:35:24,680 --> 00:35:26,320
That pot deserved to be kicked.

903
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,800
But as for me getting beaten up,

904
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:30,920
I didn't deserve that, right?

905
00:35:32,640 --> 00:35:33,240
True,

906
00:35:33,760 --> 00:35:35,160
even though he wasn't the one who hit me,

907
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,280
it was his soldier.

908
00:35:37,680 --> 00:35:38,480
Not only did he

909
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:39,960
fail to discipline his soldier,

910
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:42,080
he even tried to cover for him.

911
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:44,280
Why else would he get a warning too?

912
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:44,880
Right?

913
00:35:47,200 --> 00:35:48,440
It's only been a few days,

914
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:50,320
and he's leading a team to compete.

915
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:53,480
If he actually places in it,

916
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:54,680
wouldn't that be

917
00:35:54,680 --> 00:35:56,400
sending a message to everyone

918
00:35:56,720 --> 00:35:57,800
that professional skills

919
00:35:57,960 --> 00:36:00,760
can override military discipline?

920
00:36:01,520 --> 00:36:03,000
That mistakes don't matter,

921
00:36:03,680 --> 00:36:05,080
as long as your skills are excellent,

922
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:07,360
all your blemishes can be wiped clean.

923
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:08,600
Is that how it works?

924
00:36:09,080 --> 00:36:10,080
I don't think so.

925
00:36:12,720 --> 00:36:14,520
This Call for Talent...

926
00:36:15,200 --> 00:36:17,240
First, you need true talent.

927
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:18,880
My understanding of true talent

928
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:20,680
is having both virtue and ability.

929
00:36:21,640 --> 00:36:23,400
Guo Zijian has some unorthodox talent,

930
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:24,600
I'll admit that.

931
00:36:25,360 --> 00:36:27,120
But when it comes to his moral character,

932
00:36:27,320 --> 00:36:28,720
doesn't it still need to be evaluated?

933
00:36:29,600 --> 00:36:30,520
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

934
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,480
please don't think

935
00:36:32,960 --> 00:36:34,720
I have a personal prejudice against him.

936
00:36:35,080 --> 00:36:35,880
I really don't.

937
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:38,400
I'm just worried that other soldiers

938
00:36:38,400 --> 00:36:39,680
might have an issue with him.

939
00:36:40,440 --> 00:36:41,280
Don't you agree?

940
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:46,760
Letting Guo Zijian

941
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:48,440
be the Support Unit Leader

942
00:36:48,640 --> 00:36:50,600
was already an act of leniency.

943
00:36:51,040 --> 00:36:52,360
I believe that over these past days,

944
00:36:52,600 --> 00:36:53,920
he must have learned something.

945
00:36:54,880 --> 00:36:55,760
However,

946
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:57,920
whether we should let him participate

947
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:59,560
in this Call for Talent competition,

948
00:37:00,040 --> 00:37:00,880
our Party committee

949
00:37:01,240 --> 00:37:02,280
should still be cautious.

950
00:37:03,520 --> 00:37:04,800
I'm not targeting him,

951
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:07,720
it's just that the timing right now

952
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:10,120
is too sensitive.

953
00:37:10,640 --> 00:37:11,880
I'm afraid of controversy.

954
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:15,560
Old Suo,

955
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,360
I'll say it again.

956
00:37:18,360 --> 00:37:19,960
We should still focus on

957
00:37:20,080 --> 00:37:21,600
cultivating talents for combat

958
00:37:21,600 --> 00:37:23,360
and deploying talents for combat

959
00:37:23,720 --> 00:37:24,800
when evaluating Guo Zijian.

960
00:37:25,920 --> 00:37:27,720
If fear of controversy

961
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,200
makes us too timid

962
00:37:29,760 --> 00:37:31,280
to boldly select talents,

963
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:33,720
putting a young officer's future

964
00:37:33,720 --> 00:37:34,640
at a complete dead end,

965
00:37:35,840 --> 00:37:36,640
wouldn't that be

966
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:38,360
unfair to Guo Zijian?

967
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,200
No, Commissar,

968
00:37:40,240 --> 00:37:41,560
that's not what I meant.

969
00:37:42,120 --> 00:37:43,040
I just

970
00:37:43,040 --> 00:37:44,720
want him to slow down a bit

971
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:45,880
and learn

972
00:37:46,920 --> 00:37:47,880
to consider the bigger picture.

973
00:37:48,080 --> 00:37:48,920
I believe

974
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,600
there will be plenty of opportunities.

975
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:52,920
Besides,

976
00:37:53,240 --> 00:37:54,360
for him, this is also

977
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:55,600
a kind of test,

978
00:37:55,600 --> 00:37:57,120
to see if he can keep his composure

979
00:37:57,400 --> 00:37:59,360
and truly resolve his own issues.

980
00:38:00,080 --> 00:38:00,880
Think about it.

981
00:38:01,080 --> 00:38:02,520
If in this competition,

982
00:38:02,520 --> 00:38:03,560
he ends up winning,

983
00:38:05,080 --> 00:38:08,000
it will cover up many of his flaws,

984
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:10,240
which is bad for his growth.

985
00:38:29,560 --> 00:38:30,880
Captain, have some water.

986
00:38:38,440 --> 00:38:39,440
Did you guys hear?

987
00:38:39,720 --> 00:38:40,720
For this Call for Talent,

988
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,040
the rankings are already set.

989
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:43,840
Stop talking nonsense!

990
00:38:43,840 --> 00:38:44,560
How come I didn't know?

991
00:38:45,560 --> 00:38:46,240
I'm telling you,

992
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:48,240
I heard this competition of ours

993
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:50,240
is tailor-made for Guo Zijian.

994
00:38:51,040 --> 00:38:52,520
You believe that crap?

995
00:38:52,840 --> 00:38:54,400
Does Guo Zijian have that much pull?

996
00:38:54,560 --> 00:38:56,320
Putting on such a grand competition

997
00:38:56,320 --> 00:38:57,760
just to hype up Guo Zijian?

998
00:38:58,360 --> 00:38:59,280
Impossible.

999
00:38:59,760 --> 00:39:00,600
Anyway,

1000
00:39:00,600 --> 00:39:02,040
there's no smoke without fire.

1001
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:03,600
Captain.

1002
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:05,480
Don't listen to their nonsense.

1003
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:06,800
They're just talking trash.

1004
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:12,520
It's fine.

1005
00:39:13,080 --> 00:39:13,800
Let's continue.

1006
00:39:22,480 --> 00:39:23,400
Withdraw?

1007
00:39:23,840 --> 00:39:24,440
Yes.

1008
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:26,760
Ignore those idle rumors.

1009
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:28,720
The Call for Talent tolerates no fraud.

1010
00:39:29,040 --> 00:39:30,480
Everyone is equal before opportunity.

1011
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:32,800
Just go all out and do it.

1012
00:39:34,640 --> 00:39:36,120
I was too eager for success.

1013
00:39:37,280 --> 00:39:39,280
Now really isn't the best time.

1014
00:39:43,280 --> 00:39:44,920
You need to think this through.

1015
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:48,160
If you miss this chance, it's gone.

1016
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:49,840
A military career

1017
00:39:50,120 --> 00:39:51,200
is both long

1018
00:39:51,200 --> 00:39:52,280
and short.

1019
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:54,960
If you mess up a crucial step,

1020
00:39:55,560 --> 00:39:57,160
you might fall behind later.

1021
00:39:57,960 --> 00:39:58,800
I understand.

1022
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:00,960
I've already hit rock bottom,

1023
00:40:01,720 --> 00:40:03,160
so I don't care what they say.

1024
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:05,400
But I don't want

1025
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:07,600
a fair and square competition

1026
00:40:07,600 --> 00:40:08,280
to be tainted because of me.

1027
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:09,440
Rest assured,

1028
00:40:09,640 --> 00:40:11,160
I will use my own way

1029
00:40:11,640 --> 00:40:12,720
to stand back up,

1030
00:40:12,960 --> 00:40:14,000
and shut everyone up.

1031
00:40:14,600 --> 00:40:15,560
Your own way?

1032
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:17,920
What way?

1033
00:40:19,040 --> 00:40:20,320
You'll see when the time comes.

1034
00:40:21,080 --> 00:40:22,120
He really said that?

1035
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:23,320
He sure did.

1036
00:40:25,120 --> 00:40:25,720
In my opinion,

1037
00:40:25,720 --> 00:40:27,120
this isn't necessarily a bad thing.

1038
00:40:29,120 --> 00:40:29,760
Ling Jun,

1039
00:40:30,520 --> 00:40:32,640
I've been hearing some gossip lately,

1040
00:40:33,520 --> 00:40:35,480
saying that your Call for Talent

1041
00:40:35,480 --> 00:40:36,640
already has a predetermined winner.

1042
00:40:36,760 --> 00:40:38,120
Who makes this stuff up?

1043
00:40:38,240 --> 00:40:39,360
Don't they have anything better to do?

1044
00:40:39,360 --> 00:40:39,960
Sir,

1045
00:40:40,160 --> 00:40:41,480
don't listen to their nonsense.

1046
00:40:43,680 --> 00:40:44,640
Guo Zijian

1047
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:45,840
withdrawing at the last minute

1048
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:47,360
isn't a sign of backing down in my eyes.

1049
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:48,720
It shows

1050
00:40:49,040 --> 00:40:50,360
he has learned respect.

1051
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:52,160
He knows to consider others.

1052
00:40:52,640 --> 00:40:54,680
This is basic respect for our cause,

1053
00:40:55,120 --> 00:40:56,280
and the most responsible

1054
00:40:56,440 --> 00:40:57,840
assessment of himself.

1055
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:00,400
Sir,

1056
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:01,800
I think this kid

1057
00:41:02,120 --> 00:41:03,520
definitely has a plan in mind.

1058
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:04,640
He said

1059
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:06,400
he wants to do it his own way.

1060
00:41:07,240 --> 00:41:08,920
Who knows what he's gearing up for.

1061
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:10,400
Good.

1062
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:12,160
Then let's wait and see.

1063
00:41:13,640 --> 00:41:14,240
Ling Jun,

1064
00:41:14,800 --> 00:41:16,000
this Call for Talent of yours

1065
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:17,920
is getting a very strong response now.

1066
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:19,240
Even the Army Headquarters knows about it.

1067
00:41:20,600 --> 00:41:21,840
So no matter what,

1068
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,600
you must organize this tournament well.

1069
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:25,400
Show the true skill level,

1070
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,520
and select true talents.

1071
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:29,160
Rest assured, Sir.

1072
00:41:30,600 --> 00:41:31,160
Have some water.

1073
00:41:31,360 --> 00:41:31,840
Okay.

1074
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:38,600
Guo Zijian.

1075
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:41,800
What do you want?

1076
00:41:42,160 --> 00:41:43,880
Heard you quit the Call for Talent.

1077
00:41:45,040 --> 00:41:46,760
The Support Unit needs me here.

1078
00:41:47,200 --> 00:41:48,240
Staying right here

1079
00:41:48,240 --> 00:41:49,080
gives me peace of mind.

1080
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:50,120
Is that so?

1081
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:53,200
A few rumors were enough to knock you down.

1082
00:41:54,720 --> 00:41:55,800
How pathetic.

1083
00:41:58,120 --> 00:41:59,920
But I guess it's for the best.

1084
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,520
You finally learned what shame is.

1085
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:03,160
Thanks for the compliment.

1086
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:06,640
Guo Zijian,

1087
00:42:08,920 --> 00:42:09,920
are you even a man?

1088
00:42:10,840 --> 00:42:11,680
Li Songwei...

1089
00:42:13,160 --> 00:42:13,920
Lin Yihu...

1090
00:42:14,040 --> 00:42:15,840
They followed you with absolute loyalty,

1091
00:42:16,040 --> 00:42:17,360
and you just throw in the towel like this?

1092
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:19,480
And I actually considered you a rival.

1093
00:42:20,200 --> 00:42:20,840
Do you even deserve it?

1094
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,160
Are you done?

1095
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:23,440
I have a ton of work to do.

1096
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:24,800
Then it will just have to wait!

1097
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:30,320
To tell you the truth,

1098
00:42:31,800 --> 00:42:32,960
in this Call for Talent competition,

1099
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:37,400
you were the only rival I wanted to face.

1100
00:42:40,440 --> 00:42:42,200
Thanks for the high praise, Cmdr. Jiang.

1101
00:42:42,440 --> 00:42:43,560
I'll give you a chance.

1102
00:42:44,520 --> 00:42:45,800
As long as you can win the championship.

1103
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:47,480
What do you mean?

1104
00:42:48,920 --> 00:42:49,760
Figure it out yourself.
